The legislative texts in this repository are from the Laws of Belize page of the Attorney General's Ministry,
Government of Belize, https://agm.gov.bz/laws. The site states no licence for reuse, and its footer says
"All Rights Reserved". The Copyright Act, Chapter 252, has no exclusion for legislation, and section 25(4) gives
the State copyright in works made by or under the direction or control of the Government. No legal basis for
republishing the texts was found. They are reproduced without change to their wording; only the arrangement (one
file per section, one paragraph per line) is Lexifina's. This repository is private and must stay private unless
the Attorney General's Ministry gives permission.

Lexifina's own contributions (tools, file arrangement, commit messages and documentation) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
